{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_SENTRY",
      "label": "Sentry",
      "description": "Plugin officiel Grafana Labs (grafana-sentry-datasource), a installer sur l'instance Grafana Cloud. Auth : token d'organisation Sentry (scope org:read, project:read, event:read).",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "grafana-sentry-datasource",
      "pluginName": "Sentry"
    },
    {
      "name": "DS_INFINITY",
      "label": "Infinity (UptimeRobot)",
      "description": "Plugin communautaire yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource, gratuit, appelle l'API REST UptimeRobot en JSON. Cle API UptimeRobot a stocker en Secure Field du datasource, jamais en clair dans une requete.",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
      "pluginName": "Infinity"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    { "type": "grafana", "id": "grafana", "name": "Grafana", "version": "10.0.0" },
    { "type": "datasource", "id": "grafana-sentry-datasource", "name": "Sentry", "version": "1.0.0" },
    { "type": "datasource", "id": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource", "name": "Infinity", "version": "2.0.0" }
  ],
  "title": "Bacchana - Sante prod",
  "uid": "bacchana-sante-prod",
  "description": "Disponibilite, latence et erreurs de production Bacchana (PWA lataverne.beloucif.com). Sources : Sentry (erreurs), UptimeRobot via Infinity (disponibilite/latence), liens vers PostHog (produit, pas de datasource native fiable) et RevenueCat (revenu, achat unique a vie). Voir docs/OBSERVABILITE.md pour le branchement complet.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "tags": ["bacchana", "sre", "production"],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "PostHog - Produit, activation et conversion",
      "url": "https://eu.posthog.com/project/238190/dashboard/867195",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "RevenueCat - revenu (achat unique a vie)",
      "url": "https://app.revenuecat.com/projects/2b8d469c",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "sentry_org",
        "label": "Organisation Sentry",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "blf-labs",
        "current": { "text": "blf-labs", "value": "blf-labs" }
      },
      {
        "name": "sentry_project",
        "label": "Projet Sentry",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "bacchana",
        "current": { "text": "bacchana", "value": "bacchana" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Disponibilite et performance (UptimeRobot)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilite 30 jours",
      "description": "custom_uptime_ratio=30 sur le monitor UptimeRobot de lataverne.beloucif.com. Seuil d'alerte : < 99 %.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource", "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 99 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 99.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource", "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}" },
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "format": "table",
          "url": "https://api.uptimerobot.com/v2/getMonitors",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body_type": "form-data",
            "body_form": [
              { "key": "api_key", "value": "${secureData.uptimerobotApiKey}" },
              { "key": "format", "value": "json" },
              { "key": "custom_uptime_ratios", "value": "30" }
            ]
          },
          "root_selector": "monitors",
          "columns": [
            { "selector": "friendly_name", "text": "Monitor", "type": "string" },
            { "selector": "custom_uptime_ratio", "text": "Uptime30j", "type": "number" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Temps de reponse (ms)",
      "description": "response_times renvoyes par UptimeRobot pour le monitor principal, fenetre glissante 24 h.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource", "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource", "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}" },
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "format": "timeseries",
          "url": "https://api.uptimerobot.com/v2/getMonitors",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body_type": "form-data",
            "body_form": [
              { "key": "api_key", "value": "${secureData.uptimerobotApiKey}" },
              { "key": "format", "value": "json" },
              { "key": "response_times", "value": "1" },
              { "key": "response_times_limit", "value": "100" }
            ]
          },
          "root_selector": "monitors[0].response_times",
          "columns": [
            { "selector": "datetime", "text": "Time", "type": "timestamp_epoch" },
            { "selector": "value", "text": "Latence", "type": "number" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Derniers incidents (down/up)",
      "description": "logs=1 sur getMonitors : historique des bascules down/up du monitor principal.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource", "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource", "uid": "${DS_INFINITY}" },
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "format": "table",
          "url": "https://api.uptimerobot.com/v2/getMonitors",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body_type": "form-data",
            "body_form": [
              { "key": "api_key", "value": "${secureData.uptimerobotApiKey}" },
              { "key": "format", "value": "json" },
              { "key": "logs", "value": "1" },
              { "key": "logs_limit", "value": "20" }
            ]
          },
          "root_selector": "monitors[0].logs",
          "columns": [
            { "selector": "type", "text": "Type", "type": "number" },
            { "selector": "datetime", "text": "Quand", "type": "timestamp_epoch" },
            { "selector": "duration", "text": "Duree (s)", "type": "number" },
            { "selector": "reason.detail", "text": "Detail", "type": "string" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Erreurs (Sentry)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top issues non resolues (7 jours)",
      "description": "queryType=issues, query=is:unresolved, sort=freq. Colonne release pour retrouver la version fautive (voir release=pkg.name@pkg.version dans monitoring.ts).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-sentry-datasource", "uid": "${DS_SENTRY}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-sentry-datasource", "uid": "${DS_SENTRY}" },
          "queryType": "issues",
          "organizationSlug": "$sentry_org",
          "projectSlug": "$sentry_project",
          "query": "is:unresolved",
          "sort": "freq",
          "statsPeriod": "7d"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Issues actives",
      "description": "Nombre de tickets Sentry non resolus sur 7 jours. Seuil d'alerte : > 10 nouvelles erreurs / heure (voir docs/OBSERVABILITE.md).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 10 },
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-sentry-datasource", "uid": "${DS_SENTRY}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["count"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-sentry-datasource", "uid": "${DS_SENTRY}" },
          "queryType": "issues",
          "organizationSlug": "$sentry_org",
          "projectSlug": "$sentry_project",
          "query": "is:unresolved",
          "sort": "freq",
          "statsPeriod": "7d"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Produit et revenu (hors datasource native)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "PostHog - activation, retention, conversion",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "PostHog n'a pas de datasource Grafana officielle fiable : les tableaux de bord produit restent dans PostHog.\n\n- [Dashboard \"Produit - activation et conversion premium\"](https://eu.posthog.com/project/238190/dashboard/867195) (projet EU 238190)\n- Entonnoir premium : `premium_paywall_viewed` -> `subscribe_started` -> `subscribe_completed`\n- Joueurs actifs par jour : uniques sur `session_completed`\n\nVoir `docs/OBSERVABILITE.md` et le fichier d'insights `docs/grafana/posthog-insights.json` pour la definition exacte de chaque encart."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "RevenueCat - revenu",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Modele : paiement unique 14,99 EUR a vie + packs a la carte 2,99 EUR. Aucun abonnement, aucun MRR, aucun churn a suivre.\n\n- [Dashboard RevenueCat](https://app.revenuecat.com/projects/2b8d469c) - revenu cumule, nombre d'acheteurs, produit `premium_lifetime`\n- Recoupement avec l'entonnoir PostHog via le `product_id` (identique des deux cotes, voir PRICING.md)"
      }
    }
  ]
}
